{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Don't Ask Me", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "The Future Continuous and Future Perfect Tenses vs. Regular Future Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\"> Future Continuous tense</span> to discuss something happening at a specific time in the future.<br/>Use the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> to talk about an action in the future before a specific time in the future. <br> Look at the chart for a comparison of the other future tenses.  ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"talk about things that are not decided; <br/>make a decision at the moment of speaking for the future; <br/>make predictions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I probably <span class=\\\"strong\\\">won't be</span> able to make it.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about intentions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I<span class=\\\"strong\\\">'m going to go</span> to a shindig.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What <span class=\\\"strong\\\">are you planning</span> on doing over the next few years?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"when you talk about schedules\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My deadline <span class=\\\"strong\\\">is</span> early morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Continuous\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the action will have started before that moment but it will not have finished at that moment\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ll be sitting</span> at my desk and cranking out material.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"think of the Future Perfect tense like the Present Perfect tense, but instead of your viewpoint being in the present, it is in the future\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">will have worked</span> freelance for a full year in a couple of months. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "By this time next year, I'll have found that position and made some money.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If I haven't, I'll be starting up my own company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "My five year plan is that I'll have become more stable financially and more secure in my career. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I'll be writing solidly, so I probably won't be able to make it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Continuous tense </span> is: <br> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will</span> + <span class=\"italic\">be</span> + verb <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure of the <span class=\"strong\">Future Perfect tense</span> is: <br> Subject + <span class=\"italic\">will </span>+ <span class=\"italic\">have </span>+ past participle", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "secure", "type": "name"}, {"content": "safely attached in relation to something or someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll have become more stable financially and more secure in my career.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about personal qualities and job plans.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shindig", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a party", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm going to go to a shindig.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "a host of", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a \u200blarge \u200bnumber of something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  There is a host of other professions linked to yours.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "solidly", "type": "name"}, {"content": "having relative firmness", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adverb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll be writing solidly.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to get out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to move to or from a position", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think it's a good idea to get out there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hermit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone who chooses to live alone or spend most of their time alone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've been a bit of a hermit lately.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "shmooze", "type": "name"}, {"content": "talk with someone in a friendly and informal way, often for personal gain", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb) ", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think it's a good idea to get out there and shmooze with people.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le14ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I think and create a timeline about the future of my career.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about my future career goals.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask about a friends future career goals.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Think of your future in 5, 10 and 20 years from now.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a timeline of the events you think will happen related to your career for each time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about your goals with a friend using the timeline. (Use present continuous, future continuous and future perfect)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your friend about his/her goals.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "ha