ive year plan is that I'll have become more stable financially and more secure in my career. I mean, I like writing press releases, but I think I can do more.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le14ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: It's all about networking. Are you doing anything tonight around 7?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, I'm writing. My deadline is early morning.  Why?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: I'm going to go to a shindig where there will be people in the film industry and writers, editors, and a host of other professions linked to yours. I just thought if you were free, you could come.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yeah, thanks. I'll be sitting at my desk and cranking out material.", "id": 2, "time": "33000", "image": "engenn9le14ob06re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: Well it's free and Mary and I are going to be there until at least midnight, so if you finish early ...\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I'll be writing solidly, so I probably won't be able to make it.  Next time, though. I think it's a good idea to get out there and shmooze with people, especially since I've been a bit of a hermit lately.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: Let's keep in touch and maybe we can do it next time.", "id": 3, "time": "58000", "image": "engenn9le14ob06re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le14ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le14ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}